his change is added in 4.8, would upgrading the project also update its project settings?\r\n\r\nBut even if it is the case, and as I said in a previous comment - before the addition of this setting, the expected default behavior was that joypad input IS ignored in an unfocused window, as this is how keyboard and mouse events work. There are a few niche cases where a developer might not want this behavior, but my point of view is that we should see this as bringing the behavior closer to the default one expected by developers.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4744107255/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4744121486","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120399#issuecomment-4744121486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120399","id":4744121486,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGsWMjg","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"pub